  SPCX [neutral]: SpaceX (SPCX) stock traded in a state of flux this week, according to Yahoo Finance. Bloomberg reporting, as cited by Yahoo Finance, says a Tesla-SpaceX merger could be announced as early as December but may slip into early 2027. A Starship launch test with a 'double catch' of the ship and Super Heavy booster is scheduled for Friday night, and the Motley Fool reports SpaceX expects to spend $35 billion to $40 billion this quarter.
